        "root_concepts": "[oral, history]",
        "section": "oral-tradition",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Oral History as Method: Interview Technique, Archive, Reliability",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BOTH:\n  Oral as primary medium (at time of content creation)\n  Valuable historical evidence\n  Subject to memory limitations and self-presentation\n  Require critical methodology\n```"
    },
    {
